 "summary": "Gateway profile for three Mitsubishi indoor units (A, B, C) through an AG-150 and Procon Mod-IP/50: 72 objects (30 AI, 24 AO, 9 BI, 9 BO), 54 polled by default. Each unit has return air temperature and error code, read-back of setpoint, mode, fan speed, on/off, air direction, inhibit, ventilation and filter reset, and a matching write object for each.",
